#. Description of the plugin
#: shieldwave-security.php
msgid "Finds real threats without the false alarms: malware and backdoor scanning, file integrity against official WordPress.org checksums, file change monitoring, known vulnerabilities, injected content, exposed backups and hardening checks, with smart email alerts."
